cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IFEP, please cite this software and its associated research publication."
title: "IFEP: Integrated Fast Evolutionary Programming for Automated Material Identification"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Zajkani"
    given-names: "Asghar"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"

abstract: >-
  IFEP is a MATLAB-based research software framework for automated
  identification of material parameters in nonlinear constitutive models.
  It integrates self-adaptive evolutionary programming with multiple
  mutation strategies, population diversity mechanisms, and elitist
  selection for efficient inverse material identification.

license: MIT

repository-code: "https://github.com/zajkani/IFEP-Automated-material-identification"
